    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Builds the HTML e-mail for the human reviewer. All ticket text is HTML-escaped.\nconst t = $('Build Ticket Record').first().json;\nconst esc = (s) => String(s ?? '').replace(/&/g, '&amp;').replace(/</g, '&lt;').replace(/>/g, '&gt;').replace(/\\n/g, '<br>');\nconst link = `${t.reviewFormUrl}?${encodeURIComponent('Ticket ID')}=${encodeURIComponent(t.ticketId)}`;\nconst row = (k, v) => `<tr><td style=\"padding:4px 12px 4px 0;color:#666\">${k}</td><td style=\"padding:4px 0\"><b>${esc(v)}</b></td></tr>`;\nconst html = `<div style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;max-width:640px\">\n<h2>Support ticket needs a sentiment review</h2>\n<table>${row('Ticket ID', t.ticketId)}${row('Customer', t.customerName)}${row('Department', t.department)}${row('AI sentiment', t.sentimentAi)}${row('Received', t.receivedAt)}</table>\n<h3>Ticket text</h3>\n<div style=\"background:#f4f4f4;padding:12px;border-radius:6px\">${esc(t.ticketText)}</div>\n<p>Open the review form, choose the sentiment category (choose the same value to confirm it, another value to change it) and submit.</p>\n<p><a href=\"${link}\" style=\"background:#ff6d5a;color:#fff;padding:10px 18px;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none\">Open review form</a></p>\n<p style=\"color:#666\">If the Ticket ID is not filled in automatically, enter it by hand: <b>${esc(t.ticketId)}</b></p>\n</div>`;\nreturn [{ json: { emailSubject: `[Review needed] ${t.ticketId} - AI: ${t.sentimentAi} / ${t.department}`, emailHtml: html } }];"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1920,
        300
